ssignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/6","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/milestone/6","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/6/labels","id":655037,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjU1MDM3","number":6,"title":"backlog","description":"Low priority items. We plan to work on this but don't have a target date.","creator":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":640,"closed_issues":761,"state":"open","created_at":"2014-05-10T20:43:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T21:14:43Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2023-07-15T03:54:47Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T12:20:05Z","closed_at":"2025-05-06T12:20:04Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":{"id":597163,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAGK_Pc4ACRyr","name":"Bug","description":"An unexpected problem or behavior","color":"red","created_at":"2024-01-25T10:10:19Z","updated_at":"2024-07-26T10:12:30Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Problem\n\nWhen Nvim receives a CSI sequence with 17 or more arguments, it outputs the following error message and crashes:\r\n```\r\n*** stack smashing detected ***: terminated\r\n                                           Aborted (core dumped)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe cause of this issue is in the `peekkey_csi` function at line 533 of `driver-csi.c` in libtermkey. The buffer that stores the arguments for the CSI sequence is declared with a size of 16, causing a buffer overflow when trying to store the 17th argument.\r\nApplying the following patch to `driver-csi.c` can mitigate the problem:\r\n```patch\r\n532,533c532,533\r\n<   size_t args = 16;\r\n<   long arg[16];\r\n---\r\n>   size_t args = 32;\r\n>   long arg[32];\r\n```\r\n\r\nAccording to the documentation, Nvim sends `CSI ? u CSI c` during startup. Some terminal emulators respond to this with `CSI ? 65;1;2;3;4;6;7;8;9;15;18;21;22;29;39;42;44 c`, which has more than 16 arguments. As a result, Nvim crashes during startup.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run `nvim --clean`\r\n1. Send `\\x1b[?65;1;2;3;4;6;7;8;9;15;18;21;22;29;39;42;44c` to Nvim\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo crash\n\n### Neovim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.9.1, libtermkey 0.22\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nno, vim 9.0.1628\n\n### Operating system/version\n\n`Linux alarmpi 6.1.35-4-rpi-ARCH #1 SMP Sun Jun 25 13:05:28 MDT 2023 armv7l GNU/Linux`\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nRLogin (x64) Version 2.28.3 (2023/07/03) https://github.com/kmiya-culti/RLogin\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\n`sudo pacman -Syu neovim`","closed_by":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/24356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/24356/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}